      "final_answer": "`_EXACT` is case-insensitive:\n\n```python\nr\"</?exact[-_]answer\\b|BEGIN\\s+EXACT\\b\"\n```\n\n- Matches opening/closing prefixes such as `<exact-answer`, `</exact_answer`, including mixed case. No closing `>` is required.\n- Matches `BEGIN EXACT` with one or more whitespace characters\u2014including newlines\u2014between words.\n- `\\b` requires a word boundary afterward: `EXACTLY` and `exact-answer_extra` don't match, but `exact-answer-more` does.\n- Searches anywhere, including code fences. There\u2019s no boundary before `BEGIN`, so `REBEGIN EXACT` also matches.\n\nA match in either input blocks changed text and restoration. Identical valid text still passes because identity is checked first.\n\nNo files were edited.",
